# Icon_Ball - the cue ball on the HUD ("Shots", ball slots). Same materials as Ball_Basic (warm white, cool
# shadows) at 16 px: one glint top-left, a form-shadow crescent bottom-right with a thin reflected rim.
size 16 16
key
  K #2b2e40  ink (outer line)
  W #e9ebf1  ball base
  s #c3c8d8  shadow / reflected light
  S #9097b2  core shadow
  H #ffffff  highlight
strokes
  ellipse K 8 8 6.9 6.9
seeds
  W 8 8
